• Strong  Python  skills for data analysis/automation (Pandas, NumPy, scripting)   &nbsp;

• Good understanding of analytics concepts: KPIs, trends, segmentation, reporting logic   &nbsp;

• Strong attention to detail and ability to explain insights clearly to stakeholders   &nbsp;

  &nbsp;

Good to Have (Nice-to-have / Optional)   &nbsp;

